      "start_seconds": 1.01,
      "end_seconds": 2.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "welcome make yourself comfortable"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.53,
      "end_seconds": 9.79,
      "duration_seconds": 5.26,
      "text": "Hi doctor, I got here as fast as I could."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.43,
      "end_seconds": 16.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "so what can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.32,
      "end_seconds": 28.0,
      "duration_seconds": 6.68,
      "text": "Yeah, it's a chesty cough for a week. I don't know what's causing it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.24,
      "end_seconds": 33.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "can you tell me when it it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.96,
      "end_seconds": 41.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "It's been going on for four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.67,
      "end_seconds": 52.22,
      "duration_seconds": 10.55,
      "text": "right, right tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.6,
      "end_seconds": 62.17,
      "duration_seconds": 8.57,
      "text": "It happens once or twice a day. Only honey, and it's not much. Moderate, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.34,
      "end_seconds": 77.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.8,
      "end_seconds": 92.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.69,
      "end_seconds": 112.4,
      "duration_seconds": 9.71,
      "text": "okay: respiratory rate 15 pulse 82 pressure 112 over 82 temperature is 37.0 degrees SpO2 98 percent on room air"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.46,
      "end_seconds": 115.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.22,
      "end_seconds": 123.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "they help me see the whole picture, more shortly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.94,
      "end_seconds": 128.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second make yourself comfortable"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.4,
      "end_seconds": 132.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.35,
      "end_seconds": 147.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "your chest is clear and your oxygen is normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.25,
      "end_seconds": 153.22,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.97,
      "end_seconds": 166.07,
      "duration_seconds": 9.1,
      "text": "All finished, thank you. Let me check a few things. Any coughing up blood, chest pain, breathlessness or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.36,
      "end_seconds": 173.79,
      "duration_seconds": 6.43,
      "text": "I haven't had coughing up blood, chest pain, breathlessness or fever, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.7,
      "end_seconds": 180.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "anything with your heart like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.72,
      "end_seconds": 183.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "nothing like that"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.52,
      "end_seconds": 199.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "right, any regular medication, tablets or creams?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.27,
      "end_seconds": 203.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "no, I don't take any tablets"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.2,
      "end_seconds": 216.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.3,
      "end_seconds": 224.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "nothing, I haven't had any operations"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.15,
      "end_seconds": 230.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.04,
      "end_seconds": 234.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "I'm allergic to milk, I get stomach cramps"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.94,
      "end_seconds": 241.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "alright tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 246.76,
      "end_seconds": 250.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "I have migraines for nearly five years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.66,
      "end_seconds": 254.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "I follow and alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.07,
      "end_seconds": 257.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.41,
      "end_seconds": 260.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.54,
      "end_seconds": 265.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.56,
      "end_seconds": 267.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 268.32,
      "end_seconds": 272.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.91,
      "end_seconds": 274.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 276.09,
      "end_seconds": 280.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.68,
      "end_seconds": 302.39,
      "duration_seconds": 5.71,
      "text": "having listened and examined the most likely explanation is acute viral bronchitis"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.82,
      "end_seconds": 306.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.54,
      "end_seconds": 328.32,
      "duration_seconds": 20.78,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like acute viral bronchitis. Antibiotics will not help; fluids, rest and honey are best and the cough can last three weeks. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 332.25,
      "end_seconds": 334.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Alright, thanks, take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.32,
      "end_seconds": 336.69,
